OL,3,GNEWSAMore flat blocks evacuated over
OL,4,Astructural issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in two more blocks of flats
OL,7,Fin east London have been told to
OL,8,Fevacuate their homes a week after three
OL,9,Fother blocks of flats were evacuated
OL,10,Fdue to "serious structural issues" in
OL,11,Fthe buildings.
OL,13,FNewham Council said it had set up a
OL,14,Frest centre to support residents from
OL,15,FThanet Tower and Prince Court in
OL,16,FCanning Town, who were told to evacuate
OL,17,Fon Friday.
OL,19,FIt follows the evacuation of 221
OL,20,Fhouseholds from Sovereign Tower,
OL,21,FCenturion Tower and St Vincent Court on
OL,22,F22 October.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
