OL,3,GNEWSAMore flat blocks evacuated over
OL,4,Astructural issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Property Management, which
OL,7,Fmanages the buildings, previously said:
OL,8,F"We recognise the enormity of asking
OL,9,Fanyone to leave their home. These are
OL,10,Fnot decisions we have made lightly,
OL,11,Fbut... safety is our immediate
OL,12,Fpriority."
